# Only Rust workspace inputs and licenses; never send runtime fixtures or environment files.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/**
!LICENSE
!COMMERCIAL-LICENSING.md
!NOTICE
**/target
**/.git
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json
**/*secrets*.json
**/*private*.json
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*kubeconfig*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/*.log
